%% MUPP-032 No focus ring after a tap
%% What happens to the focus ring after a tap or a key.
flowchart TD
    A[Tap or click] --> B[pointerdown: data-pointer on html]
    B --> C[Dialog opens or closes, an element gets the focus]
    C --> D[No ring: R1]
    D --> E{Next input}
    E -- key, also Tab or Esc --> F[keydown: data-pointer removed, ring shown: R2]
    E -- tap --> B
    G[Key] --> F
